4. Agent-badge (mods/agent-badge, internal/badge)
-------------------------------------------------

mods/agent-badge is a git submodule (https://github.com/GlacierHubAB/agent-badge)
and is embedded in the binary (den.go, go:embed) so `den` can install the mod.
It is Den's own sibling project, MIT licensed, "Copyright (c) 2026 GlacierHub
AB" (its LICENSE, embedded alongside it); it is not third-party code and needs
no separate notice beyond that file.

internal/badge is a Go port of the name generator in agent-badge's
hooks/register.tsx (same author), so that both tools give a session the same
critter name. The algorithms it reproduces, 32-bit FNV-1a and the mulberry32
generator, are public-domain-style well-known algorithms; no third-party source
code was copied. There is no external original to credit.

5. Other embedded data
----------------------

internal/templates/builtin.json (go:embed) is Den's own team templates. No
fonts, images or other vendored third-party data are embedded in the binary.
